    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Order is not an idea. It is a budget, a road network, and somebody staying late to sign the papers.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The Emperor (Administrator).</strong> Civic architect, system-builder, and keeper of functional continuity. You turn collapse into policy and policy into Athletics.</p>\n<h3>Archetype Effects</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your faction’s economy stretches farther around you. This Archetype is associated with <strong>+3 Economy OPs</strong> in faction calculus.</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for the full tactical and strategic expression of logistics, management, civic control, and state capacity.</li>\n</ul>",
